[00:19.15]1. Jehovah, God of love,
[00:38.30]You have promised us your peace.
[00:42.30]So we ask you for your spirit;
[00:47.30]May its fruitage yet increase.
[00:51.30]Our faith in your dear Son,
[00:54.04]Who is loyal, ever true,
[01:00.64]Gives us access to your friendship;
[01:05.24]We are now at peace with you.
[01:14.30]2. Your spirit aids our sight
[01:22.90]As your Word gives needed light.
[01:25.87]We are guided and protected
[01:28.85]In a world as dark as night.
[01:31.82]Until the time has come
[01:34.54]When all wars and terrors cease,
[01:37.82]May your spirit bless our efforts
[01:42.33]To maintain our godly peace.
[01:46.83]3. You’ve gathered those you love,
[02:09.31]Both in heaven and on earth,
[02:13.53]We’re united by your spirit
[02:18.53]To proclaim the Kingdom’s birth.
[02:24.57]Your righteous Kingdom rule
[02:28.57]Soon will bring an end to war.
[02:32.57]Then the meek ones will delight to
[02:38.07]Live in peace forevermore.